scenario a13_jul_sale over a13_jul
  tally 2
  from 2023-01-01
  note "A-13 (b): as (a), with Ania's 200 gifted units sold at DM Kopia on 15 December 2023, at that day's price and with no fee, instead of when she sold them (questions.md A-13). The units then never move to Rzeka: the DM Kopia transfers out, the Rzeka transfers in, the Rzeka sale of 2024-03-07 and the BRZ-MM-A purchase made with its proceeds are removed (L 6.4: replace … = none). What she does with the sale's money later isn't asked, so it stays in a cash account at DM Kopia, kop_cash."
  note "The sale is a planned movement of this layer on a day after the DM Kopia register's coverage (a13b_coverage), so it is booked, and it takes the gifted lots at DM Kopia first in, first out (the holding's lots kept as batches, invest.tally). The base's net_gain sums every lot's gain (lot_gain, lot_exempt), a gifted lot's cost and 5-year test included (lot_cost, held_from), so it needs no rule of this layer."
  note "The sale's money is Ania's, as the units it is in exchange for were (CIV-1 .3, civ1_arrive in places.tally)."

place kop_cash: money_accounts DUK lives 2023-12-15..

input a13b_round: rounding question "How is the sale's money (price times units) rounded to the ort?"

input a13b_sale_day: date question "On which day are the gifted units sold at DM Kopia?"

input a13b_units: num glb question "How many gifted units are sold at DM Kopia?"

move a13b_sale: fund_sales
  on a13b_sale_day
  at a13b_sale_day
  leg units from kop_glb to market amount a13b_units
  leg cash from market to kop_cash amount round(mk[glb] * a13b_units, minor(DUK), a13b_round)
  leg fee from kop_cash to market amount 0 DUK
  note "questions.md A-13 (b): the 200 gifted units sold at DM Kopia at that day's price, with no fee"

ask a13_b_sale: s.day, s.units.amount, s.cash.amount, s.fee.amount for s in fund_sales over 2023 where s.units.from == kop_glb in a13_jul_sale law 2025-04-30 as known 2025-04-30

ask a13_b_lots: g.bought, s.units.amount of g, lot_gain[g, s], not lot_exempt[g, s] for s in fund_sales over 2023, g in gifts_in over .. where s.units.from == kop_glb and s.units.amount of g > 0 in a13_jul_sale law 2025-04-30 as known 2025-04-30

version a13b_stipulation
  cite questions
  governs 2023-01-01..
  known 2023-01-01
  note "the question's stipulation, as if known then (L 6.4)"
  replace abank[a20240212_003] = none "questions.md A-13 (b): the units are sold at DM Kopia, so they never move to Rzeka"
  replace abank[a20240212_004] = none "questions.md A-13 (b): never moved to Rzeka"
  replace abank[a20240212_005] = none "questions.md A-13 (b): never moved to Rzeka"
  replace abank[a20240307_006] = none "questions.md A-13 (b): instead of when she sold them"
  replace abank[a20240307_007] = none "questions.md A-13 (b): the BRZ-MM-A purchase was made with that sale's proceeds"
  replace kbank[k20240212_06] = none "questions.md A-13 (b): never moved to Rzeka"
  replace kbank[k20240212_07] = none "questions.md A-13 (b): never moved to Rzeka"
  replace kbank[k20240212_08] = none "questions.md A-13 (b): never moved to Rzeka"

version a13b_coverage
  cite questions
  governs 2023-01-01..
  known 2023-09-13
  moves kop_register to 2023-09-12..2023-12-14
  note "the DM Kopia register's coverage ends the day before the sale: the sale is this layer's planned movement, not a row of the register, and a planned movement on a covered day is modelled past, never booked or bound (L 5.19); the register's rows after it, the transfers out, are removed. A moves line names a version known before its own (LOAD-MOVES), so this version is known the day after the register's first rows, after the gift and before the sale"

version a13b_terms
  cite questions
  governs always
  known 2023-01-01
  a13b_round = half-up assumed "the question states no rounding of price times units; a price to 2 places times whole units is a whole number of orts, so no mode changes it" "questions.md A-13 (b)"
  a13b_sale_day = 2023-12-15 "questions.md A-13 (b): sold at DM Kopia on 15 December 2023"
  a13b_units = 200 "questions.md A-13 (b): Ania's 200 gifted units"

version a13b_price
  cite market_files
  known 2023-12-15
  mk[glb] = 187.73 at 2023-12-15 "brz-glb-a.csv line 1514"
